ure carbon-12" 12 g of carbon-12 is found to contain $6.022 \times 10^{23}$ atoms of carbon-12. Thus, a mole represents a collection of 6.022 x 10 chemical units and the number is called the Avogadro''s number. alcohol to form ethyl acetate. The density of acid and alcohol are 1 g/mL and 0.7 g/mL respectively. The limiting reagent in this reaction is') ON CONFLICT (question_code) DO UPDATE SET raw_text = EXCLUDED.raw_text, content = EXCLUDED.content;
